  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Are you looking for a university in Poland that excels in academic rigour and practical skills? Then VIZJA University is the right choice. VIZJA University, also known as the University of Economics and Human Sciences in Warsaw, is a private university specialising in finance, management, social sciences, and human sciences.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At VIZJA University, you’re going to have a fun-filled student life. You’ll meet people from all over the world, and be in a multicultural student community.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>VIZJA University offers you modern and comfortable accommodation options. You can choose between one-bed, two-bed, or three-bed shared rooms, all within walking distance of the campus. These rooms come with all the amenities you need, including WiFi, laundry, and more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>VIZJA University has a state-of-the-art library where you can access thousands of academic journals, books, and online resources.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
